<title>USA: Scudder to allow fund mgmt via Internet.</title>
<headline>Scudder to allow fund mgmt via Internet.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scudder Funds said it will launch new Internet-based services during the fourth quarter of this year.</p>
<p>Scudder said, that under the plans, it will allow shareholders to manage their mutual fund accounts via the Internet.</p>
<p>Scudder said its fund investors will be able to review accounts, and move assets between Scudder funds.There will be no charges for changes made via the Internet.</p>
<p>Scudder currently manages over $30 billion in open-end funds.</p>
</text>
